#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst:4
msgid "Connectors and Wires"
msgstr "连接器和电线"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst:6
msgid ""
"There are many types of connectors for use in FTC\\ |reg|. Here are the most"
" common connectors you will find on an FTC robot."
msgstr "FTC\\ |reg| 中有多种类型的连接器。以下是 FTC 机器人上最常见的连接器。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst:9
msgid "Anderson PowerPole"
msgstr "安德森 PowerPole"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst:11
msgid ""
"Anderson PowerPole is a connector used by AndyMark on their :term:`NeveRest "
"motors <NeveRest Motor>`. PowerPole connectors are extremely reliable, and "
"are an excellent choice for high-usage connectors, such as batteries. There "
"are adapters available to/from other systems. PowerPole connectors are "
"crimped onto wires."
msgstr ""
"Anderson PowerPole 是一种由 AndyMark 用于其 :term:`NeveRest 电机<NeveRest Motor>` "
"的连接器。PowerPole 连接器极其可靠，是电池等高使用频率连接器的绝佳选择。另有可与其他系统互连的适配器。PowerPole "
"连接器通过压接方式与电线连接。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst:14
msgid ""
"While OEM Anderson brand PowerPole connectors are extremely reliable, off-"
"brand PowerPole connectors, commonly available on sites like Amazon, often "
"have major reliability issues. When purchasing PowerPole connectors, only "
"purchase ones specifically listed as Anderson brand."
msgstr ""
"虽然原厂（OEM）安德森（Anderson）品牌的PowerPole连接器极其可靠，但在亚马逊等网站上常见的非原厂PowerPole连接器却常常存在严重的可靠性问题。购买PowerPole连接器时，请务必只选购明确标注为安德森（Anderson）品牌的產品。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst:16
msgid ""
"Additionally, it is important to use crimpers specifically designed for "
"PowerPole connectors. The `IWISS iCrimp AP-11 "
"<https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MSQPTDS>`_ crimpers are a solid choice at a "
"reasonable price point on Amazon, though any quality crimpers specifically "
"designed for PowerPole should work fine."
msgstr ""
"此外，务必使用专为 PowerPole 接头设计的压接钳。亚马逊上售价合理的 `IWISS iCrimp "
"AP-11<https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MSQPTDS>`_ 压接钳是个不错的选择，不过任何专为 PowerPole "
"设计的优质压接钳应该都能正常使用。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst-1
msgid "A PowerPole connector"
msgstr "一个 PowerPole 连接器"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst:21
msgid "3.5mm Bullet"
msgstr "3.5毫米圆头插头"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst:23
msgid ""
"A power connector used on the goBILDA Yellow Jacket motors. Bullet "
"connectors are soldered onto wires."
msgstr "goBILDA Yellow Jacket 电机上使用的电源连接器。子弹头连接器通过焊接固定在电线上。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst:26
msgid ""
"Due to the relatively strong holding force and the small size, it is common "
"for teams to unplug these connectors by pulling on the wires instead of "
"pulling on the connectors. This will cause fatigue and eventually failure. "
"If you find yourself often operating these connectors, it is recommended to "
"replace them with a connector that can be easily unplugged without damaging "
"the connector, such as the :term:`JST VH` or :term:`Anderson PowerPole` "
"connectors."
msgstr ""
"由于其夹持力相对较强且体积较小，团队通常会通过拉扯线缆而非直接拉动连接器来拔下这些连接器。这会导致连接器疲劳，最终导致失效。 "
"如果您需要频繁操作这些连接器，建议将其更换为易于拔出且不会损坏连接器的类型，例如 :term:`JST VH` 或 :term:`Anderson "
"PowerPole` 连接器。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst-1
msgid "A 3.5mm Bullet connector"
msgstr "一个 3.5 毫米 子弹头连接器"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst:31
msgid "Dupont 0.1\" (TJC8)"
msgstr "杜邦 0.1英寸 (TJC8)"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst:33
msgid ""
"A small pinheader connector commonly used on servos and occasionally on some"
" sensors. Dupont connectors are crimped onto wires."
msgstr "一种小型针脚排接头，常用于伺服电机，偶尔也用于某些传感器。杜邦接头是通过压接方式连接到导线上的。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst:38
msgid ""
"Some vendors sell versions of the 3-pin female connector that are locking, "
"which significantly improve the reliability of using servo extension wires. "
"BackBayRC on Amazon sells `servo extension wires with locking connectors "
"<https://www.amazon.com/BackBayRC-Extension-Strands-Vehicles-"
"bikes/dp/B0CXR2YBS4/>`_; and Ferra Components sells both `pre-made servo "
"extension wires with locking connectors "
"<https://ferracomponents.com/products/20awg-locking-servo-wire>`_, and "
"`packs of locking connectors you can crimp yourself "
"<https://ferracomponents.com/products/servo-locking-connector>`_."
msgstr ""
"一些供应商销售带锁定功能的3针母头连接器，这大大提高了使用伺服延长线时的可靠性。 "
"亚马逊上的BackBayRC销售`带锁定连接器的伺服延长线<https://www.amazon.com/BackBayRC-Extension-"
"Strands-Vehicles-bikes/dp/B0CXR2YBS4/>`_；而Ferra "
"Components则同时销售`带锁定连接器的预制伺服延长线<https://ferracomponents.com/products/20awg-"
"locking-servo-"
"wire>`_，以及`可供自行压接的锁定连接器套装<https://ferracomponents.com/products/servo-"
"locking-connector>`_。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst:0
msgid "Locking female 3-pin Dupont connectors"
msgstr "带锁定功能的3针杜邦母头连接器"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst-1
msgid "A servo extension wire with 3-pin Dupont connectors"
msgstr "一条带3针杜邦连接器的伺服延长线"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst:44
msgid "XT30"
msgstr "XT30"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst:46
msgid ""
"The XT30 connector is commonly used by batteries (such as the goBILDA Nested"
" Battery and the REV Slim Battery), the robot power switch, the REV Control "
"Hub and Expansion Hub, the :term:`REV Grounding Strap <Grounding Strap>`, "
"and others. XT30 connectors are soldered onto wires."
msgstr ""
"XT30 接头通常用于电池（例如 goBILDA 嵌套电池和 REV 超薄电池）、机器人电源开关、REV 控制集线器和扩展集线器、:term:`REV "
"接地带<Grounding Strap>` 等设备。XT30 接头需焊接在电线上。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst:49
msgid ""
"The pins in the XT30 connectors on the Control Hub and Expansion Hub often "
"compress over time, causing loose power connectivity. See `XT30 Pins are "
"Compressed - Expansion Hub Troubleshooting "
"<https://docs.revrobotics.com/duo-control/troubleshooting-the-control-"
"system/expansion-hub-troubleshooting#xt30-pins-are-compressed>`_ for details"
" on the issue and how to fix it."
msgstr ""
"控制集线器和扩展集线器上的 XT30 连接器中的触点随着时间推移往往会发生压缩，导致电源连接松动。有关此问题及解决方法的详细信息，请参阅 `XT30 "
"触点压缩 - 扩展集线器故障排除<https://docs.revrobotics.com/duo-control/troubleshooting-"
"the-control-system/expansion-hub-troubleshooting#xt30-pins-are-"
"compressed>`_。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst-1
msgid "A XT30 connector"
msgstr "一个 XT30 连接器"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst:54
msgid "JST VH"
msgstr "JST VH"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst:56
msgid ""
"JST VH is a type of connector used by FTC motors to interface with the REV "
"Control Hub and Expansion Hub. It is keyed and locks into place for "
"excellent reliability. JST VH connectors are crimped onto wires."
msgstr ""
"JST VH 是一种用于 FTC 电机与 REV 控制集线器和扩展集线器连接的连接器。该连接器采用键槽设计，可锁定到位，可靠性极佳。JST VH "
"连接器需通过压接方式安装在电线上。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst-1
msgid "A JST VH connector"
msgstr "一个 JST VH 连接器"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst:61
msgid "JST PH"
msgstr "JST PH"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst:63
msgid ""
"JST PH is a type of connector used by the REV Control/Expansion Hubs and "
"various electronics, such as sensors. On the REV Control/Expansion Hubs, the"
" 4-pin connector is used for encoder, I2C, analog, and digital connections. "
"The 3-pin connector is used for the RS-485 connection between the Control "
"Hub and Expansion Hub. JST PH connectors are crimped onto wires."
msgstr ""
"JST PH 是一种连接器，用于 REV 控制/扩展集线器以及各种电子设备（如传感器）。在 REV 控制/扩展集线器上，该 4 "
"针连接器用于编码器、I2C、模拟和数字连接。 3 针连接器用于控制集线器与扩展集线器之间的 RS-485 连接。JST PH "
"连接器需通过压接方式安装在导线上。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst-1
msgid "JST PH and JST XH connectors"
msgstr "JST PH 和 JST XH 连接器"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst:68
msgid "JST XH"
msgstr "JST XH"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst:70
msgid ""
"JST XH connectors are used for the encoder connections on goBILDA (MATRIX) "
"and AndyMark NeveRest motors. Both vendors sell adapters from JST XH to the "
":term:`JST PH` encoder ports on the REV Control/Expansion Hubs. These "
"connectors are also occasionally found on some third party sensors. JST XH "
"connectors are crimped onto wires."
msgstr ""
"JST XH 连接器用于 goBILDA（MATRIX）和 AndyMark NeveRest 电机上的编码器连接。 这两家供应商均销售将 JST XH"
" 转换为 REV 控制/扩展集线器上 :term:`JST PH` 编码器端口的适配器。某些第三方传感器上偶尔也会使用此类连接器。JST XH "
"连接器需通过压接方式与导线连接。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst:71
msgid "Tamiya"
msgstr "田宫"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst:73
msgid ""
"Used on some batteries, such as the Modern Robotics battery that was sold by"
" goBILDA prior to goBILDA's own battery design being allowed by the "
"competition manual."
msgstr "用于某些电池，例如 goBILDA 在其自主设计的电池获得竞赛手册批准之前销售的 Modern Robotics 电池。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst:76
msgid ""
"Do not use these connectors! The metal connectors are fragile and will lead "
"to random disconnects. It is highly recommended to replace any of these "
"connectors with a reliable type of connector, such as the :term:`Anderson "
"PowerPole` connectors."
msgstr ""
"请勿使用这些连接器！金属连接器易碎，会导致连接意外断开。强烈建议将此类连接器更换为可靠的连接器，例如 :term:`Anderson "
"PowerPole` 连接器。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/connectors-and-wires.rst-1
msgid "A Tamiya connector"
msgstr "一个田宫连接器"
